; The plugin's Rocq-level tests (Test.v) and development benchmarks
; (DevTest.v). Built by `dune build` and CI. Not part of the opam package
; (there is no `(package ...)`), so `dune build -p rocq-mebi @install`, which
; is what opam runs, neither builds nor installs them: DevTest.v alone was
; ~50s of that build, and users do not need either.
;
; They are not in theories/ because dune maps a directory to one logical path,
; so a second theory there would shadow MEBI.
(rocq.theory
 (name MEBITests)
 (synopsis "MEBI plugin tests")
 (plugins rocq-mebi.mebi)
 (stdlib yes)
 (theories Stdlib MEBI))
